        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions WST125SMTSS4, 1-1/4 Inch Diameter Modern Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Wasatch Collection by First Impressions is known for its modern style. This pull has a 1-1/4 inch diameter and is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. Choose back-to-back mounting, surface mounting, or thru-bolt mounting. The 1-1/4 Inch Diameter Stainless Wasatch Pull is available in 4 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching\r\n<a href=\"/products/1-inch-diameter-stainless-wasatch-pull-first-impressions-wst100smtss4\"><b>1\" Diameter Wasatch Pull</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/1-1-2-inch-diameter-stainless-wasatch-pull-first-impressions-wst150smtss4\"><b>1-1/2\" Diameter Wasatch Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions WST125SMTSS4 1-1/4\" Diameter Stainless Steel Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-WST02-specifications.pdf?v=1704262331\"><b>First Impressions WST125SMTSS4 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>WST125012SMTSS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>WST125024SMTSS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>WST125036SMTSS4:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 7 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the pull, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
